D[13311]={"Schematic: Mechanical Dragonling",1,40,0,7,55,0,"INV_Scroll_03",{},"Requires Engineering (200)\nUse: Teaches you how to make a Mechanical Dragonling.\n\nMechanical Dragonling\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\nRequires Level 30\nRequires Engineering (200)\nUse: Activates your Mechanical Dragonling to fight for you for 1 min.  It requires an hour to cool down before it can be used again. (5 Min Cooldown)\n\nRequires Bronze Framework, Iron Strut (4), Gyrochronatom (4), Citrine (2), Fused Wiring",0}
